{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Imagine if Beer Pong grew legs and turned into a chaotic physics brawler.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle in heated matches or just have fun with abilities, this demo gives you a taste of the full party experience.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10 levels across 2 distinct environments</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 7 different powerups</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 unique abilities</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Local and Online Multiplayer support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the Trickshotting chaos you can ask for</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About Trickshotterz</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Score in the Top, or Not at All</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063410/extras/d45474daa53d44c119510bfc73d7efb4.poster.avif?t=1759161637\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063410/extras/d45474daa53d44c119510bfc73d7efb4.webm?t=1759161637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to <strong>4 players</strong>, locally or online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate opponents by landing your shot in the <strong>top of their cup\u00a0</strong>\u2014 or blast them off the stage instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull off <strong>bounce plays</strong>, <strong>wild ricochets</strong>, and <strong>satisfying trickshots </strong>to secure the round.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Powerups That Flip the Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063410/extras/57d1b35b6154c38672dedcd75d03705b.poster.avif?t=1759161637\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063410/extras/57d1b35b6154c38672dedcd75d03705b.webm?t=1759161637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pickup wild powerup balls that spawn mid-match and flip the game in your favor:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire an <strong>RPG</strong> that bursts into a frenzy of mini balls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steer a<strong> Remote-Control Ball</strong>\u00a0to hit impossible angles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch a<strong> Shockwave Ball</strong>\u00a0to send opponents into the stratosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash a<strong> mini black hole</strong> that devours everything around it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...<strong>with even more chaotic surprises waiting to be discovered</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every powerup is physics-driven, and designed for <strong>chaotic, clip-worthy \u201cYOOOOOOO!\u201d moments.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick an Ability Before the Match</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063410/extras/731fc61b0c487884d61f3e494e9b73bf.poster.avif?t=1759161637\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063410/extras/731fc61b0c487884d61f3e494e9b73bf.webm?t=1759161637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each set of rounds, choose<strong> one ability</strong>\u00a0to define your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice reshapes how you fight and score\u00a0\u2014 adding strategy on top of the chaos.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wind Blast:</strong> parry incoming attacks\u00a0\u2014 or just blast players away</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash:</strong>\u00a0dodge danger by inches or reposition for your next big shot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Undying:</strong>\u00a0after death return as a ghost\u00a0\u2014 possess whoever you score on and control them</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...and more abilities that completely change the way you play</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shoot From the Grave</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063410/extras/35b42b25072bc89359c3b08f96e65d63.poster.avif?t=1759161637\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063410/extras/35b42b25072bc89359c3b08f96e65d63.webm?t=1759161637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you\u2019re holding a ball or powerup when eliminated, you get one final shot before hitting the ground.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It could be the difference between a draw and <strong>total defeat.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4063410?t=1759161637","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4063410?t=1759161637","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063410/7d7fc37830be6961a7eb876e8585866c1dd7e4fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759161637","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.a